### ──────────────────────────────────
### LECTURA (CRUD automàtic JPA)
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Llistar tots els productes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Obtenir producte per ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Producte inexistent (esperar 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Comptar productes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/count

### Existeix producte 1?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/exists

### Existeix producte 999?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999/exists

### Ordenar per preu ascendent
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/sorted?by=price&dir=ASC
Accept: application/json

### Ordenar per nom descendent
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/sorted?by=name&dir=DESC
Accept: application/json

### ──────────────────────────────────
### ESCRIPTURA (CRUD automàtic JPA)
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Crear producte (INSERT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maduixes del Maresme",
  "price": 3.50,
  "description": "Maduixes fresques ecològiques 500g",
  "category": "Fruita",
  "stock": 45
}

### Actualitzar producte 1 (UPDATE via save)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Poma Golden ECO",
  "price": 1.80,
  "description": "Poma ecològica certificada",
  "category": "Fruita",
  "stock": 100
}

### Eliminar producte
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/5

### Verificar eliminació
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/5
Accept: application/json

### ──────────────────────────────────
### CATEGORIES (Exercici 4)
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Crear categoria
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fruita",
  "description": "Fruites fresques de temporada"
}

### Crear altra categoria
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Verdura",
  "description": "Verdures de proximitat"
}

### Llistar categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Accept: application/json
